take all reasonable steps to ensure your fair treatment. 
 
2.3  Royal Square Financial and the financial advisor are paid commission and / or fees, based on the products they are accredited to sell. There 
may be an additional administrative fee from the product provider. 
 
2.4  The financial advisor declares that apart from the receipt of commission and / or fees, no other personal interest in concluding any 
transaction exists. Further, there are no circumstances that may give rise to an actual or potential conflict of interest. 
 
2.5  The financial advisor declares that, should a personal interest exist (other than the receipt of commission and / or fees), s/ he undertakes to 
inform you of the nature of the conflict and s/ he will take all reasonable steps to ensure fair treatment to you. 
 
